### PetJeeva API — REST Client test collection
### VS Code extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
###
### 1) Start the backend and set @baseUrl below.
### 2) Run health check.
### 3) Complete registration/login, then paste returned access token into @token.
### 4) Replace IDs with real IDs returned by your API.
###
### IMPORTANT:
### Request body field names are starter examples. The route file supplied does not
### include controller validation/schema, so align payloads with your controllers.
### Do not run destructive requests (account deletion, pet/address deletion, booking
### cancellation) against production data.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2YjA0MWRjYjYzMTQyMTI3YTQ3YzAxMmYiLCJyb2xlIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJhY2NvdW50U3RhdHVzIjoiYWN0aXZlIiwiaWF0IjoxNzk1NTI1NjYxLCJleHAiOjE3OTU1MjY1NjF9.sESvt1E95FEDa9Ozm2OwTeGaqat2IkCkgnsRNIo6ORM

@refreshToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2YjA0MjQwMzZlNzZmYzdhMGM5ZDE1YWIiLCJyb2xlIjoidHJhaW5lciIsInRva2VuVHlwZSI6InJlZnJlc2giLCJpYXQiOjE3OTU0MzkzMTUsImV4cCI6MTc5NjA0NDExNX0.--piHJza0QIY7n4_z_MJVGGXet8YUWtXRhSniQXQm1k

@addressId = 6b043c446e76fc7a0c9d15f8

@petId = 6b043cc06e76fc7a0c9d15fc
@professionalId = PASTE_PROFESSIONAL_ID_HERE

@bookingId = 6b05578d6d6b86cf9eb5e125

